<title>UK: CYCLING-BRITON MISSES LONGO WORLD BEST.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BRITON MISSES LONGO WORLD BEST.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Yvonne McGregor, 36, failed to recapture the women's world one hour cycling record on Wednesday.</p>
<p>She covered 47.608 kms in her attack on the 48.159 kms set by world and Olympic champion Jeannie Longo last November in the altitude of Mexico City.</p>
<p>Halfway through Wednesday's attempt, McGregor was faster than Longo by seven seconds but faded in the second half.</p>
</text>
